      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On behalf of the memers that includes, me, GreatMoonAroma and Lolathon (Who use VIVE controls)\nWe've been having the same problems with the new menu randomly activating animations/gestures.\nThat goes the same with moving, turning and jumping (etc)\nIt does get extremely annoying when you wanna do something simple as moving, turning or jumping having an animation or sound effect going off every 2 seconds.\nHopefully the devs will fix this because this is a huge issue for VIVE users.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
