      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This must be what I was experiencing. Since the update my gestures have felt slightly awkward and I've been constantly pulling my shocked facial expression accidentally (one I use sparingly), often without realising. It's something which never really happened before. I was trying to figure out if the track pad segments had changed in size, but this seems a more likely explanation of the bug.\nWhatever it is, something is very plainly wrong, and hopefully can be resolved soon.",
      "viewerReactions": null
