      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A similar problem is also with Windows Mixed Reality controllers. (This is also on vive controllers, not just wmr) When you hold trigger to use a gesture with vive advanced controls it will stop the gesture while you press the touchpads. Doesnt matter where you press them, it just stops the gesture. If you hold the right trigger and press the right touchpad it stops the right gesture, if you hold the left trigger and press the left touchpad it stops the left gesture. this is pretty annoying if you want to turn around while still playing a gesture, because it will reset and run from the beginning",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
