      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2d6db6f6abbf61555c304d|full_name}: It's not fully fixed sadly. Before, the fist was 100% controlled analogue. If I was pulling my trigger really quick, it would close the fist really quick. That still isn't the case and on top of that, when I just slightly open my hand again, it just opens completely instead even when the trigger is technically still halfway pulled.",
