  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-07T15:39:43.680Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Vive controllers are completely broken during this update.\nIt used to be when you try to gesture, you move your finger to the position on the track pad and when you move, you press on the track pad.\nNow when you move around and lift your fingers to stop moving, it will activate your gestures. It just feels very oversensitive to gesture your fingers. Moving around will cause you to do some gestures like fingerpoint really easily.\nSometimes gestures feel really delayed and broken, mostly the fist gesture when playing around with the trigger it makes other gestures instead of fist\nNavigating around with the new menu causes you to use your gestures, also when disabling gestures with the menu, you get stuck with thumbs up",
